:: Carter House Frontyard [nobr]

<<set $Location to {
    Name: "Carter Frontyard",
    Indoors: 0,
    Safe: 0,
    Nudity: 0,
    Public: 1,
    Environment: "Front Yard",
}>>
<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Carter's Frontyard--</strong></big></span><br>

You stand at the start of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s Frontyard. The mailbox is bright red with the name “Kent” painted onto it. The yard is overall very well kept, with grass the looks to be mowed often and a driveway without any visible cracks. A small birdbath sits in middle of the yard, though judging by how clean it looks, you’d wager birds often ignore it. A short stone path leads up to a wooden patio where the front door sits.<br>
<br>

<span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Actions-</strong></span><br>

